Alias   Bc_SIGNAL   B_c+
Alias   Bcbar_SIGNAL    B_c-
ChargeConj    Bc_SIGNAL   Bcbar_SIGNAL
#
Alias   MyJ/psi   J/psi
ChargeConj    MyJ/psi   MyJ/psi
#
Decay Bc_SIGNAL
# model as in the B_c+ block of DECAY.DEC, where the e and mu modes
# have equal BR (0.019 each), so the 50:50 split is the physical ratio
    0.5   MyJ/psi   mu+    nu_mu    PHOTOS  PHSP;
    0.5   MyJ/psi   e+     nu_e     PHOTOS  PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay    Bcbar_SIGNAL
#
Decay MyJ/psi
    0.5   mu+   mu-    PHOTOS  VLL;
    0.5   e+    e-     PHOTOS  VLL;
Enddecay
End
